  description: 'You can Ritual Summon this card with "Mikanko Kagura". Cannot be
    destroyed by battle, also your opponent takes any battle damage you would have
    taken from battles involving this card. If you have this card in your hand or
    GY, and another "Mikanko" card in your GY: You can target 1 face-up monster on
    the field; equip this card to it as an Equip Spell. You can only use this effect
    of "Arahime the Manifested Mikanko" once per turn. Once per turn, during the
    End Phase, while this card is equipped to a monster: You can return this card
    and the equipped monster to the hand.'
